{# this is the presentational component file for the image atom #}
{#
/**
 * @file
 * Presentational "Image" atom — reusable <img> element.
 *
 * Covers every repeated <img> pattern across the washington-hub
 * organisms/molecule: card photos (class="image"), small heading icons
 * (class="icon", empty alt), and the callers that need no class at all
 * (Filter By Articles Card, Nav Share Breadcrumbs' social icons).
 *
 * Variables:
 * - url: image src (string, required).
 * - alt: alt text (string, default '').
 * - image_class: CSS class on the <img> (string, default ''). Omit or
 *   pass '' when no class is wanted.
 * - loading: 'lazy' | 'eager' (string, optional) — adds the loading
 *   attribute when set (Nav Share Breadcrumbs uses lazy).
 */
#}
<img{% if image_class %} class="{{ image_class }}"{% endif %} src="{{ url }}" alt="{{ alt|default('') }}"{% if loading %} loading="{{ loading }}"{% endif %}>
